/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 153 0 R
/E (Because both operating systems run natively on bare-metal, the conventional hypervisor-mediated VirtIO doorbell mechanism, which relies on VM exits, cannot be used. The architecture therefore replaces it with direct physical Inter-Processor Interrupts \(IPIs\) for signaling notifications, eliminating software traps entirely.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
